# AGH Logic Unit - Official Clang-Format for Embedded C/C++ & Firmware
BasedOnStyle: Google
Language: Cpp
Standard: c++20
IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 100
UseTab: Never
PointerAlignment: Right
SortIncludes: CaseSensitive
IncludeBlocks: Regroup
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Inline
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
